Package: ROED
Type: Package
Title: Robustly Optimal Exact Designs for Randomized Dose Optimization
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Haohaostats",
           email = "haocstats@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Constructs robustly optimal exact designs for randomized
    dose-optimization trials with co-primary binary toxicity and efficacy
    endpoints. The package determines dose-specific sample sizes and integer
    decision thresholds under exact strong familywise error control and a
    finite-scenario maximin generalized-power requirement. It also evaluates
    exact operating characteristics, produces protocol-ready decision rules,
    and applies a completed design to final toxicity and efficacy counts.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/haohaostats/ROED
BugReports: https://github.com/haohaostats/ROED/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    graphics,
    grDevices,
    stats,
    utils
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
